<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-liangshu" book-id="b-liangshu-022" chapter-id="c-liangshu-022-xiaohong-sons-jingli" source-id="s-liangshu-022-xiaohong-sons-jingli-ws1513347">
  <p id="c-liangshu-022-xiaohong-sons-jingli:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">臨川靖惠王<persName id="c-liangshu-022-xiaohong-sons-jingli:p001:m0005" ref="m5k_t3s_umk">宏</persName>字<persName id="c-liangshu-022-xiaohong-sons-jingli:p001:m0007" ref="m5k_t3s_umk">宣達</persName>，太祖第六子也。</p>
  <p id="c-liangshu-022-xiaohong-sons-jingli:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-022-xiaohong-sons-jingli:p002:m0000" ref="m5k_t3s_umk">宏</persName>有七子：正仁，正義，<persName id="c-liangshu-022-xiaohong-sons-jingli:p002:m0011" ref="m5k_t3s_umk_A">正德</persName>、正則，<persName id="c-liangshu-022-xiaohong-sons-jingli:p002:m0017" ref="m5k_t3s_umk_B">正立</persName>，正表，正信。</p>
  <p id="c-liangshu-022-xiaohong-sons-jingli:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">高祖嘉而許之，改封<persName id="c-liangshu-022-xiaohong-sons-jingli:p003:m0009" ref="m5k_t3s_umk_B">正立</persName>爲建安侯，邑千戶。卒，子<persName id="c-liangshu-022-xiaohong-sons-jingli:p003:m0023" ref="m5k_t3s_umk_BA">賁</persName>嗣。</p>
</text>
